**Designing label summary helpers**

I’m planning to add new helper functions around `_label_distribution` to collect detailed label summaries, including fine labels, layers, and similarity groups. Then I’ll update `_render_dataset_card` to consume this richer summary instead of just the label distribution, carefully handling presence or absence of multi-label columns and formatting the output cleanly. This will keep the original distribution intact while expanding reporting capabilities.
