I'm designing `_resolve_metric_set_version` to extract version info from several nested config locations, keeping it simple but flexible. Then I'll add `_update_export_meta` to read and update a JSON meta file with dataset and version info, ensuring the data is a dict or else raising an error. I'll place these functions near related taxonomy and labeling spec helpers for logical organization before applying the patches.
