Using skills: S20_HYDRA_CONFIG, S40_PROCESS_IMPLEMENTATION, S70_VISUALIZATION_DS to align config/process changes and dataset card reporting.

Updated export to hash dataset_id from resolved config + taxonomy + optional labeling spec + metric set, serialize multi-label columns before validation, and emit a richer dataset card in both root and `reports/`. In `src/synthlab/processes/export.py` I wired `export.labeling_spec_path`, captured `labeling_spec_hash` into meta/manifest/card, added dataset card sections for fine/derived labels and similarity groups, and included the report card in manifest/checksums/packages. `conf/wafer_particles/export/default.yaml` now exposes `labeling_spec_path`, docs in `docs/04_ARTIFACTS_AND_VERSIONING.md` reflect the new dataset_id hash inputs, and `tests/test_T0507_export_dataset_id_and_card.py` verifies dataset_id stability vs. spec changes plus card presence.

